{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-benzene-threading-emergence","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:benzene-threading-emergence","kind":"proposition","title":"Threading link $T(2,6)$ emerges as the LP-optimal $\\pi$ configuration","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-q-integer-mass-formula","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-benzene-molecular-braid","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-co2-lp-dual-binding"],"tags":["benzene","threading-link","delocalization","LP-dual","aromatic","emergence"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Molecular.benzene_threading_emergence","text":"benzene-threading-emergence.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"prop:benzene-threading-emergence\"></a>\n<strong>Proposition.</strong> <em>Threading link <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T(2,6)</code> emerges as the LP-optimal <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\pi</code> configuration</em></p>\n<p><strong>Proposition (conditional on <a href=\"#conj:q-integer-mass-formula\"><code>conj:q-integer-mass-formula</code></a>).</strong>\n<em>The LP dual of the benzene molecular braid in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_{120}(q)</code> selects the threading link <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T(2, 6) = (\\sigma_1\\sigma_2 \\cdots \\sigma_5)^2</code> as the optimal <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\pi</code>-electron configuration.</em></p>\n"}
